1 OCCU Marquis de Mancini, Prince de Fénétrange, Pair de France, Brigadier des Armées du Roi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jules, 1st Duke of Polignac was a French nobleman and husband of Yolande de Polastron, the confidant of Queen Marie Antoinette. He was the first Duke of Polignac. He died at the age of seventy one.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Jules François Armand on June 7, 1746 at Claye-Souilly to Louis Héracle Armand de Polignac, Marquis of Polignac and his wife, Diane Adélaide Zéphirine Mancini herself a grand daughter of the Duke of Nevers and the Duke of Noa
2 CONC illes. He bore the title of Marquis of Mancini. He was the couples fourth child (out of five) and their second son.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7 July 1767 he married Gabrielle Yolande Claude de Polastron. His wife was later the favourite of Marie Antoinette. As a result, Jules was created a duke on 20 September 1780. At the revolution, he fled France and died in Saint
2 CONC  Petersburg at the age of 71. The Prince of Monaco is a descendant of Jules and his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:  [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jules,_1st_Duke_of_Polignac Wikipedia]
