1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Karl Anton Friedrich Fürst von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 20 February 1785 at Sigmaringen, Baden-Württemburg, Germany. He was the son of Anton Aloys Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Amalie Prinzessi
2 CONC n von Salm-Kyrburg. He married, firstly, Antoinette Marie Murat, Princesse Murat, daughter of Pierre Murat, in 1808. He married, secondly, Katherine Prinzessin zu Hohenlohe-Waldenburg-Schillingsfürst, daughter of Karl Albrecht Pri
2 CONC nz zu Hohenlohe-Waldenburg-Schillingsfürst, in 1848. He died on 11 March 1853 at age 68 at Sigmaringen, Baden-Württemburg, Germany.
