2 CONT Last Edited=15 Dec 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Natalie de Ligne, Princesse de Ligne was born in 1835. She married Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ, son of Alfred Franz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ and Eleonore Wilhelmine Luise Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, in 
2 CONC 1853. She died in 1863.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Natalie de Ligne, Princesse de Ligne gained the title of Princesse Natalie de Ligne. (1)
2 CONT
