1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alfred Franz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #96936, b. 22 December 1789, d. 14 July 1861
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=7 Nov 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfred Franz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ was born on 22 December 1789. He was the son of Auguste Philippe Louis Emanuel Herzog von Croÿ and Anne-Victurniene Henriette de Rochechouart. He married Eleonore Wilhelmine Luis
2 CONC e Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, daughter of Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid, on 21 June 1819. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 14 July 1861 at age 71.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Alfred Franz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ succeeded to the title of 10th Herzog von Croÿ in 1822.
2 CONT
