2 CONT
2 CONT      Philipp Franz Prinz von Croÿ was born on 26 November 1801. He was the son of Auguste Philippe Louis Emanuel Herzog von Croÿ and Anne-Victurniene Henriette de Rochechouart. He married Johanna Wilhelmine Auguste Prinzessin zu S
2 CONC alm-Salm, daughter of Konstantin Alexander Joseph Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Maria Walburga Gräfin von Sternberg-Manderscheid, on 28 July 1824. He died on 2 August 1871 at age 69 at Ems, Germany.
