1 OCCU Karl Anton Joachim Zephyrin Friedrich Meinrad Fürst von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen, Prince of Hohenzollern
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Karl Anton Fürst von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 7 September 1811 at Krauchenwies, Germany. He was the son of Karl Anton Friedrich Fürst von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Antoinette Marie Murat, Princesse M
2 CONC urat. He married Josephine Prinzessin von Baden, daughter of Karl Ludwig Friedrich Großherzog von Baden and Stéphanie Louise Adrienne de Beauharnais, Vicomtesse de Beauharnais, in 1834. He died on 2 June 1885 at age 73 at Sigmarin
2 CONC gen, Baden-Württemburg, Germany.
