2 CONT * '''Henri Florent Eugéne François Joseph Lamoral, prince de Ligne''' is the son of Charles Joseph Eugene Henri Georges Lamoral de Ligne (November 17, 1837 - † May 11, 1914 Brussels - Brussels) and Charlotte (July 19, 1852 - La Ch
2 CONC apelle-sur-Oudon † June 27, 1933 - Brussels), daughter Etienne Charles de Gontaut (1818 † 1871), Marquis de Biron, it is also the little son of Eugene-I of Line Amblise and Epinoy.
2 CONT * He married Charlotte de La Trémoille (1892-1971) (en), (November 20, 1892 - October 27, 1971 † Paris - Paris), daughter of Louis Charles Marie de La Trémoille Leonie and Helen Marie Pillet-Will. They had a son, Jean-Charles de L
2 CONC igne Trémoille (in).
2 CONT * After the accidental death of Charlotte's brother, Louis Jean Marie de La Trémoille, she succeeded in her claims potentielles1 the Kingdom of Jerusalem.
