1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00012600&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Friedrich VI married Louise Le Grand on 27 December 1883 in London. According to the Almanach de Gotha (1890 edition page 175) another marriage ceremony took place in Gotha on 4 January 1884. Louise Le Grand was referred
2 CONC  to as 'Baronne de Eichhof', a title she apparently received from the duke of Saxe-Coburg-Goptha on 11 June 1885. Six children were born from this marriage. On 1 March 1917 she received the Prussian title of Freiin von Rennenberg,
2 CONC  a title also applying to the six children.
