1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #111864, b. 1823, d. 1902
2 CONT
2 CONT  Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ was born in 1823. He was the son of Alfred Franz Friedrich Philipp Herzog von Croÿ and Eleonore Wilhelmine Luise Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm. He married, firstly, Natalie de Ligne, Princes
2 CONC se de Ligne in 1853. He married, secondly, Eleonore Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, daughter of Franz Joseph Friedrich Philipp Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Marie Josephine Sophie Prinzessin zu Löwenstein-Wertheim-Rosenberg, in 1884. He died in
2 CONC  1902.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ succeeded to the title of 11th Herzog von Croÿ in 1861.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rudolf Maximilian Konstantin Herzog von Croÿ and Natalie de Ligne, Princesse de Ligne
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Eugenie Prinzessin von Croÿ+ b. 11 Oct 1854, d. 12 Jun 1889
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Isabelle Hedwig Franziska Natalie Prinzessin von Croÿ+1 b. 27 Feb 1856, d. 5 Sep 1931
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Klementine Prinzessin von Croÿ+ b. 9 Jul 1857, d. 3 Aug 1893
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Karl Alfred Herzog von Croÿ+ b. 29 Jan 1859, d. 28 Sep 1906
2 CONT
2 CONT -5. Natalie Prinzessin von Croÿ+ b. 14 Jul 1863, d. 2 Sep 1957
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p11187.htm#i111864
