2 CONT      Rudolf Pál Eugen Prinz Esterházy von Galántha was born on 27 May 1880 at Hütteldorf. (1) He was the son of Pál Antal Miklós Prinz Esterházy von Galántha and Eugenie Prinzessin von Croÿ. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 January 1962 at age 81 at Vienna, Austria. (1)
2 CONT
