2 CONT He Albrecht Franz Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 24 July 1897 at Weilburg Castle, Vienna, Austria.2 He was the son of Friedrich Maria Erzherzog von Österreich and Isabelle Hedwig Franziska Natalie Prinzessin von Croÿ.1 He ma
2 CONC rried, firstly, Irene Dora Lelbach, daughter of Johann Lelbach and Ilma Skultéty, on 16 August 1930 at Brighton, Sussex, England.2 He and Irene Dora Lelbach were divorced on 1 June 1937 at Budapest, Hungary.2 He married, secondly,
2 CONC  Juliana Katalin Bocskay de Felsö-Banya, daughter of Béla Bocskay de Felsö-Banya and Eszter Farkas, on 7 May 1938 at Budapest, Hungary, in a civil marriage.2 He and Juliana Katalin Bocskay de Felsö-Banya were divorced in 1951 at M
2 CONC orales, Mexico.2 He married, thirdly, Lydia Strauss-Dorner,daughter of Bella von Strauss Dörner end Mina Shey von Koloma, after 08.03.1951 at Buenos Aires, Argentina.3 Albrecht Franz and Juliana Katalin were also married in a reli
2 CONC gious ceremony on 9 May 1938 at Pannonhalma, Hungary.3 He died on 23 July 1955 at age 57 at Buenos Aires, Argentina.2
2 CONT      He was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduke of Austria).1 He was given the name of Albert Franz Josef Karl Friedrich Georg Hubert Maria at birth
2 CONC .3 He succeeded to the title of 4th Herzog von Teschen on 30 December 1936.1,3
