2 TITL Alfred Antony Potocki as child
2 NOTE Alfred Antoni Potocki was born on 14 June 1886 in Łańcut, and died on 30 March 1958 in La Roche-sur-Foron, France. He was the son of Roman Alfred Potocki and Elżbieta Matylda Radziwiłł. He was the fourth and at the same time the l
3 CONC ast Ordynat of Łańcut. This photograph shows Alfred Antoni as a few-year-old (four-five-year-old) boy in a marine outfit. This is portrait photograph.
3 CONT
3 CONT The photo comes from the album of the Lubomirski princes from Przeworsk.
