2 TITL Alfred Antoni Potocki
2 NOTE Alfred Antoni Potocki, 1910. Photograph depicting Alfred Antoni Potocki, the future fourth ordinary of Łańcut, riding a carriage. Alfred Potocki is shown turned three quarters, as a bust, in a white jacket and shirt with a dark ti
3 CONC e, and a tropical helmet on his head, with a cane or umbrella grip visible at his right arm. Behind the head of Alfred Potocki we see a piece of the driver’s seat with two people from the carriage service sitting. Photograph taken
3 CONC  in 1910 during Alfred Antoni Potocki’s trip to India. Aldona Cholewianka-Kruszyńska
