3 CONC  his arms crossed, beside three Egyptians, two older ones, between then a younger and smaller one, wearing turbans, burnous and jellabiyas. Behind them is a natural, sandy landscape with rocks, far in the background there is a fen
3 CONC ce of poles and wiring. Aldona Cholewianka-Kruszyńska
