3 CONC t, Anna Potocka in dark and a bright blouse and hat – both supporting themselves with canes. Cousins Alfred and Roman Potoccy wearing bright jackets and hats. The alley has a low shubbery and rising roses on the sides; in the back
3 CONC ground, a white, wooden spa house. Aldona Cholewianka-Kruszyńska
