1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [http://www.palais.mc/fr/la-famille-princiere/s-a-s-le-prince-albert-ii/biographie-1-5.html Palais]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Albert II''', Sovereign Prince of Monaco (Albert Alexandre Louis Pierre Grimaldi) born 14 March 1958 at  Palais Princier, Monaco
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reign began April 6, 2005
2 CONT * Albert II married [http://www.geni.com/people/Charlene-Wittstock/6000000009136526301 Charlene Lynette Wittstock] on 1 and 2 July 2011, at Palais Princier, Monaco.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Albert II and [http://www.geni.com/people/Tamara-Rotolo/5261366783700067369 Tamara Jean Rotolo]:
2 CONT ># [http://www.geni.com/people/Jazmin-Grimaldi/5261370655140021755 Jazmin Grace Grimaldi], born March 4, 1992.
2 CONT Children of Albert II and [http://www.geni.com/people/Nicole-Coste/5261375958030138799 Nicole Valérie Coste]:
2 CONT ># [http://www.geni.com/people/Alexandre-Coste/5261381234000100951 Alexandre Éric Stéphane Tossoukpé], born August 24, 2003 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert II is the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Rainier-III-Prince-of-Monaco/6000000003369626311 Rainier III Grimaldi, Prince of Monaco] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Grace-Kelly/5163142858250067644 Grace Kelly]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==biography==
2 CONT Albert II is the head of the House of Grimaldi and the current ruler of the Principality of Monaco. He is the son of Rainier III, Prince of Monaco, and the American actress Grace Kelly. His sisters are Caroline, Princess of Hanove
2 CONC r, and Princess Stéphanie of Monaco. 
2 CONT
