2 CONT Their Alexandra  daughter's the Swedish ancestors and families of his father's family via Hannover_ http://www.geni.com/path/Nils+Jonsson+G%C3%A4dda+is+related+to+Alexandra+Charlotte+Ulrike+Maryam+Virginia+von+Hannover+Prinzessin?
