2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Caroline, Princess of Hanover, Hereditary Princess of Monaco (Carolina Luisa Margherita Grimaldi; born 23 January 1957), is the eldest child of Rainier III, Prince of Monaco, and American actress Grace Kelly, as well as the elder 
2 CONC sister of Albert II, Prince of Monaco, and Princess Stéphanie of Monaco. She has been heiress presumptive to the throne of Monaco since 2005, a position which she previously held from 1957 to 1958. Caroline is married to Ernst Aug
2 CONC ust, Prince of Hanover (born 1954), the pretender to the former throne of the Kingdom of Hanover, as well as the genealogical heir male of George III of the United Kingdom.
