2 CONT *     He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich.1 He was given the name of '''Andreas Salvator Gabriel Gottfried Petrus Paulus Augustinus Severinus Maria Josephus Hubertus Ignatia von Habsburg-Lothringen''' at birth.
