2 CONT * E2. Andreas Salvator von Habsburg-Lothringen, Archduke of Austria, * 1936, 
2 CONT * Married.1) in 1986 (div.), Maria Espinosa de los Monteros y Rosillo, * 1953; 
2 CONT * Married.2) in 2001, Countess Valerie Podstatzky-Lichtenstein, * 1967.
