1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Austrian Branch===
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://v5.cache8.c.bigcache.googleapis.com/static.panoramio.com/photos/original/20115410.jpg?redirect_counter=2 '''Persenbeug Castle , Austria'''] - Where Michael was born on 2 May,1949
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Michael was the last born child of  Archduke Hubert Salvator of Austria & Princess Rosemary of Salm-Salm.  He is listed as their 13th child===
2 CONT * Archduke Hubert Salvator of Austria (German: Hubert Salvator Rainer Maria Joseph Ignatius, Erzherzog von Österreich, Prinz von Toskana[1][2]) (30 April 1894, Schloss Lichtenegg, Lichtenegg, Lower Austria, Austria–Hungary[1][2] –
2 CONC  24 March 1971, Schloss Persenbeug, Persenbeug-Gottsdorf, Lower Austria, Austria[1][2]) was a member of the Tuscan line of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine and Archduke and Prince of Austria, Prince of Hungary, Bohemia, and Tuscany 
2 CONC by birth.
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT * Hubert Salvator was the third child and second-eldest son[1][2] of Archduke Franz Salvator of Austria and his wife Archduchess Marie Valerie of Austria.[1][2] Through his mother, Hubert Salvator was a grandson of Franz Joseph I 
2 CONC of Austria and his wife Elisabeth of Bavaria.[1][2]
2 CONT ===Marriage and issue===
2 CONT * Hubert Salvator married Princess Rosemary of Salm-Salm, second eldest child and daughter of Emanuel Alfred, Hereditary Prince of Salm-Salm and his wife Archduchess Maria Christina of Austria, on 25 November 1926 civilly in Anhol
2 CONC t and religiously on 26 November 1926.[1][2] Hubert Salvator and Rosemary had thirteen children together:[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT #  HI&RH Archduke Friedrich Salvator of Austria (27 November 1927 - 26 March 1999).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Agnes Christina of Austria (14 December 1928 – 31 August 2007).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Maria Margaretha of Austria (born 29 January 1930).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Maria Ludovica of Austria (31 January 1931 - 17 April 1999).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Maria Adelheid of Austria (born 28 July 1933).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Elisabeth Mathilde of Austria (18 March 1935 - 9 October 1998).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduke Andreas Salvator of Austria (born 28 April 1936).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Josepha Hedwig of Austria (born 2 Sep 1937).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduchess Valerie Isabella of Austria (born 23 May 1941).
2 CONT #  HI&RH Archduchess Maria Alberta of Austria (born 1 June 1944).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduke Markus Emanuel Salvator of Austria (born 2 April 1946).
2 CONT # HI&RH Archduke Johann Maximilian of Austria (born 18 September 1947).
2 CONT # '''HI&RH Archduke Michael Salvator of Austria (born 2 May 1949)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *  30 April 1894 – 24 March 1971: His Imperial and Royal Highness Archduke and Prince Hubert Salvator of Austria; Prince Hubert Salvator of Hungary, Bohemia, and Tuscany
2 CONT * Michael's father - Honours '' Knight of the Austrian Order of the Golden Fleece''''
