1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Voir [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriella_de_Monaco '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Gabriella,_Countess_of_Carlad%C3%A8s Princess Gabriella of Monaco, Countess of Carladès Gabriella Thérèse Marie Grimaldi] From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Gabriella of Monaco, Countess of Carladès (Gabriella Thérèse Marie Grimaldi, born 10 December 2014), is the daughter of Prince Albert II and Princess Charlene and second in line to the Monegasque throne. She was born at M
2 CONC onaco's Princess Grace Hospital, two minutes before her twin brother, Hereditary Prince Jacques.[1] She was granted the title Countess of Carladès by her father.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Princely Palace of Monaco released a statement describing how the birth was to be celebrated in the principality. Forty-two cannon shots (twenty-one for each child) were to be fired from the Fort Antoine and church bells were 
2 CONC to ring for fifteen minutes, followed by boat horns. The day was declared a public holiday in Monaco.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriella has an older half-sister, Jazmin Grace Grimaldi, and an older half-brother, Alexandre Coste, from her father's relationships with Tamara Rotolo and Nicole Coste.
