2 CONT * Notes: Prinz Friedrich zu Schwarzenberg ('''full given name: Friedrich Karl Joseph Johannes von Nepomuk Antonius Bartholomaus Felix Judas Thaddaus Conrad von Parzham''') was the second son and third child of Karl, 6.Fürst zu Sch
2 CONC warzenberg (1911-1986), and his wife, Prinzessin Antonie zu Fürstenberg. He was married at Zürich on October 12, 1984 to Regula Brigitta Schlegel, with whom he had issue.
