1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marie Gabriele Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #96585, b. 31 August 1913
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Gabriele Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm was born on 31 August 1913 at Loburg, Germany. She is the daughter of Franz Emanuel Konstantin Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Maria Anna Baronin von und zu Dalberg. She married Josef Erwein von 
2 CONC Fürstenberg Graf von Deroy on 18 September 1934 at Loburg, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie Gabriele Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm gained the title of Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm. Her married name became von Fürstenberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Marie Gabriele Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm and Josef Erwein von Fürstenberg Graf von Deroy
