1 CONT
1 CONT Original name: Karl Eitel Friedrich; Reigh 1866-1914; A prince of the house of
1 CONT Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen, he was educated in Dresden and Bonn.  Carol was
1 CONT crowned as the first king of Romania in 1881.  He established a parliamentary
1 CONT form of government for the nation.  During his reigh, Romania took part in the
1 CONT Balkan Wars.  Succeded by his nephew Ferdinand I.
