0 @N6000000007329600662@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Ferdinand, Prince of Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen  (1914-1927 King of Romania)
1 CONT Because King Carol had no male heirs, he named Ferdinand (1889) heir
1 CONT presumptive to the Romanian throne.  After WWI his reign was marked by
1 CONT unsuccessful attempts at land reforms and by a problem of royal succession
1 CONT because of the relations of his son (later King Carol II) with a commoner.
0 @N6000000007329533026@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT aka: Karl Anton, Prince of Hohenzollern.
