0 @N6000000002188593909@ NOTE
1 CONT
1 CONT Prince Tomislav of Yugoslavia died aged 72 in Oplenac, Serbia - where he lived the past few years - after a long and serious illness. He had been divorced from Princess Margarita of Baden and was married to Linda Bonney. From his 
1 CONC first marriage he has a son and a daughter, both married and each parent of a daughter. From his second marriage he has two sons. Tomislav was the second son of King Aleksandar I of Yougoslavia. His brother Petar II was the last Y
1 CONC ougoslavian king. The funeral will take place in Oplenac, in the Mausoleum of the Royal Family Karadjordjevic, on July 16th in presence of many members of the family.
0 @N6000000007329642053@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Andrej was sent to London to be educated, and because war intervened, never
1 CONT returned to his native country. He eventually settle in Portugal, a country
1 CONT that has always been something of a magnet for disposses European royalty.  He
1 CONT now lives in Palm Springs, California with his third wife.  The Prince is a
1 CONT prominent Rotarian, and travels widely around the Pacific as a representative
1 CONT of Rotary International.
